Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:42:13 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: export session transcripts as WebVTT

GET /api/sessions/:id/export?format=vtt re-renders the stored bilingual
.srt (ADR-007) as a .vtt attachment for players that only accept WebVTT.
Unknown session ids return 404, unsupported or missing formats 400.
